    "summary": "Use it in your Command phase on 1 **Below Half-strength** **SQUADRON** unit of yours that is not an **OFFICER** unit. Until the battle round ends:\n\n- Its models' ranged weapons gain **[[HAZARDOUS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/hazardous)**, except **[[ONE SHOT]](vsdata:weapon-ability/one-shot)** weapons.\n- For each ranged attack its models make, you may disregard some or all modifiers to the attack's Ballistic Skill and to its **Hit roll**.",
